      <VERS vnumber="20"> She stretcheth <gr str="6566">out </gr>her <gr str="3709">hand </gr>to the <gr str="6041">poor</gr>; yea, she reacheth <gr str="7971">forth </gr>her <gr str="3027">hands </gr>to the <gr str="34">needy</gr>. </VERS>
      <VERS vnumber="21"> She is <gr str="3808">not </gr>
